` and `v8_base.cpp` (giving the snapshot step the native objects and serializing their fields). But `target.files: []` lists nothing in `external/core`, so it is outside the packet's scope. Retrying this packet can't fix that; only re-planning can.\n3. **Smaller gap:** the CPU-profile split covers docx and pptx only. The goal names docx, xlsx and pptx; the log says xlsx was not profiled.\n\n**Way forward for the planner**, since the evidence is fairly convincing that the real snapshot would fall below the 0.2 s threshold:\n- **Option a:** re-plan P2 with the `doctrenderer` and `v8_base` files in `target.files`, so the snapshot can be built and measured.\n- **Option b:** accept the profile-based upper bound as enough to decide P3, record that in DIAG-x2t, and approve this note as it is.\n\nEither way, the xlsx profile should be added.\n\nVERDICT: BLOCK Goal requires a post-warm-up snapshot built on the core fork, but target.files lists no external/core files (doctrenderer.cpp, v8_base.cpp); the planner must add them or decide the profile-based upper bound is enough for P3 (also add the missing xlsx profile)","ttft_ms":5199,"type":"result","duration_ms":34150,"uuid":"5a70156d-2d4a-4f15-8d1e-fd312e091175","ttft_stream_ms":3119,"time_to_request_ms":415,"time_to_request_phases_ms":{"other":8,"system_prompt":215,"resume_other":0,"process_user_input":3,"input_attachments":18,"input_hooks":2,"conversation_append":0,"transcript_persist":6,"tool_pool_refresh":0,"init_message":5,"init_frame_send":3,"engine_pickup":0,"loop_entry":3,"message_prep":0,"model_config_wait":1,"autocompact":2,"request_announcements":13,"query_setup":5,"auto_mode_context_wait":22,"model_gates":1,"tool_schema_build":84,"message_normalization":4,"client_creation":12,"request_build":8},"turn_start_resume_kind":"none","process_turn_index":0,"time_to_request_loop_lag_ms":152,"time_to_request_cpu_ms":208,"time_to_request_major_faults":17,"process_rss_mib_turn_start":182,"process_anon_mib_turn_start":110,"pro